{"id": "r03_01", "text": "Use the right bin for both red and blue, and the left bin for yellow.", "gt": {"red/cube": "right", "red/cylinder": "right", "red/triangle": "right", "yellow/cube": "left", "yellow/cylinder": "left", "yellow/triangle": "left", "blue/cube": "right", "blue/cylinder": "right", "blue/triangle": "right"}, "category": "colour", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r03_02", "text": "Yellow in the right bin. Blue as well. Red in the middle.", "gt": {"red/cube": "center", "red/cylinder": "center", "red/triangle": "center", "yellow/cube": "right", "yellow/cylinder": "right", "yellow/triangle": "right", "blue/cube": "right", "blue/cylinder": "right", "blue/triangle": "right"}, "category": "colour", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r03_03", "text": "Blue cubes and red cylinders go in the left bin. All remaining objects go in the right bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "right", "red/cylinder": "left", "red/triangle": "right", "yellow/cube": "right", "yellow/cylinder": "right", "yellow/triangle": "right", "blue/cube": "left", "blue/cylinder": "right", "blue/triangle": "right"}, "category": "shape", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r03_04", "text": "Each colour gets its own bin: yellow on the left, red on the right, blue in between.", "gt": {"red/cube": "right", "red/cylinder": "right", "red/triangle": "right", "yellow/cube": "left", "yellow/cylinder": "left", "yellow/triangle": "left", "blue/cube": "center", "blue/cylinder": "center", "blue/triangle": "center"}, "category": "colour", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r03_05", "text": "Of the three bins, use only two: the red and the blue objects go in the left one, and the yellow ones in the right one. Leave the middle one empty.", "gt": {"red/cube": "left", "red/cylinder": "left", "red/triangle": "left", "yellow/cube": "right", "yellow/cylinder": "right", "yellow/triangle": "right", "blue/cube": "left", "blue/cylinder": "left", "blue/triangle": "left"}, "category": "adv_unused_bin", "adversarial": true}
{"id": "r03_06", "text": "Everything blue goes in the middle bin, and everything that isn't blue goes in the right bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "right", "red/cylinder": "right", "red/triangle": "right", "yellow/cube": "right", "yellow/cylinder": "right", "yellow/triangle": "right", "blue/cube": "center", "blue/cylinder": "center", "blue/triangle": "center"}, "category": "colour", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r03_07", "text": "Everything red goes into the rightmost bin, blue into the leftmost, and yellow into the one in the middle.", "gt": {"red/cube": "right", "red/cylinder": "right", "red/triangle": "right", "yellow/cube": "center", "yellow/cylinder": "center", "yellow/triangle": "center", "blue/cube": "left", "blue/cylinder": "left", "blue/triangle": "left"}, "category": "colour", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r03_08", "text": "Place the scarlet pieces in the left container, the azure pieces in the right container, and the lemon-coloured pieces in the central container.", "gt": {"red/cube": "left", "red/cylinder": "left", "red/triangle": "left", "yellow/cube": "center", "yellow/cylinder": "center", "yellow/triangle": "center", "blue/cube": "right", "blue/cylinder": "right", "blue/triangle": "right"}, "category": "colour", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r03_09", "text": "The middle bin is only for blue items. Red goes left. Yellow goes right.", "gt": {"red/cube": "left", "red/cylinder": "left", "red/triangle": "left", "yellow/cube": "right", "yellow/cylinder": "right", "yellow/triangle": "right", "blue/cube": "center", "blue/cylinder": "center", "blue/triangle": "center"}, "category": "colour", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r03_10", "text": "Put every triangle in the left bin and leave the cubes and cylinders on the counter.", "gt": {"red/cube": null, "red/cylinder": null, "red/triangle": "left", "yellow/cube": null, "yellow/cylinder": null, "yellow/triangle": "left", "blue/cube": null, "blue/cylinder": null, "blue/triangle": "left"}, "category": "counter", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r03_11", "text": "PUT ALL THE BLUE STUFF IN THE RIGHT BIN AND EVERYTHING RED AND YELLOW IN THE LEFT ONE.", "gt": {"red/cube": "left", "red/cylinder": "left", "red/triangle": "left", "yellow/cube": "left", "yellow/cylinder": "left", "yellow/triangle": "left", "blue/cube": "right", "blue/cylinder": "right", "blue/triangle": "right"}, "category": "colour", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r03_12", "text": "Red and yellow both go in the centre bin; blue goes to the left.", "gt": {"red/cube": "center", "red/cylinder": "center", "red/triangle": "center", "yellow/cube": "center", "yellow/cylinder": "center", "yellow/triangle": "center", "blue/cube": "left", "blue/cylinder": "left", "blue/triangle": "left"}, "category": "colour", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r03_13", "text": "yellow -> centre, blue -> left, red -> right", "gt": {"red/cube": "right", "red/cylinder": "right", "red/triangle": "right", "yellow/cube": "center", "yellow/cylinder": "center", "yellow/triangle": "center", "blue/cube": "left", "blue/cylinder": "left", "blue/triangle": "left"}, "category": "colour", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r03_14", "text": "Blue objects go in the left bin. Red cubes go in the right bin. Nothing else needs to be moved.", "gt": {"red/cube": "right", "red/cylinder": null, "red/triangle": null, "yellow/cube": null, "yellow/cylinder": null, "yellow/triangle": null, "blue/cube": "left", "blue/cylinder": "left", "blue/triangle": "left"}, "category": "counter", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r03_15", "text": "Reds: left. Blues: left. Yellows: centre.", "gt": {"red/cube": "left", "red/cylinder": "left", "red/triangle": "left", "yellow/cube": "center", "yellow/cylinder": "center", "yellow/triangle": "center", "blue/cube": "left", "blue/cylinder": "left", "blue/triangle": "left"}, "category": "colour", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r03_16", "text": "Grab the yellow pieces off the counter and drop them in the centre bin, then do the same with the red pieces but use the right bin. Blue pieces go in the left bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "right", "red/cylinder": "right", "red/triangle": "right", "yellow/cube": "center", "yellow/cylinder": "center", "yellow/triangle": "center", "blue/cube": "left", "blue/cylinder": "left", "blue/triangle": "left"}, "category": "colour", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r03_17", "text": "Sort by shape rather than colour: triangular prisms go right, cylinders left, cubes in the middle.", "gt": {"red/cube": "center", "red/cylinder": "left", "red/triangle": "right", "yellow/cube": "center", "yellow/cylinder": "left", "yellow/triangle": "right", "blue/cube": "center", "blue/cylinder": "left", "blue/triangle": "right"}, "category": "shape", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r03_18", "text": "Yellow triangles and blue triangles both go in the centre bin. All other pieces go in the left bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "left", "red/cylinder": "left", "red/triangle": "left", "yellow/cube": "left", "yellow/cylinder": "left", "yellow/triangle": "center", "blue/cube": "left", "blue/cylinder": "left", "blue/triangle": "center"}, "category": "shape", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r03_19", "text": "Sort the items so that red is in the middle, blue on the left and yellow on the right.", "gt": {"red/cube": "center", "red/cylinder": "center", "red/triangle": "center", "yellow/cube": "right", "yellow/cylinder": "right", "yellow/triangle": "right", "blue/cube": "left", "blue/cylinder": "left", "blue/triangle": "left"}, "category": "colour", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r03_20", "text": "All objects go in the right bin, whatever their colour.", "gt": {"red/cube": "right", "red/cylinder": "right", "red/triangle": "right", "yellow/cube": "right", "yellow/cylinder": "right", "yellow/triangle": "right", "blue/cube": "right", "blue/cylinder": "right", "blue/triangle": "right"}, "category": "colour", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r03_21", "text": "Only move the blue things: put them in the center bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": null, "red/cylinder": null, "red/triangle": null, "yellow/cube": null, "yellow/cylinder": null, "yellow/triangle": null, "blue/cube": "center", "blue/cylinder": "center", "blue/triangle": "center"}, "category": "counter", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r03_22", "text": "Kindly move each red item to the bin on the right-hand side and each yellow item to the bin on the left-hand side; any blue item should end up in the central bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "right", "red/cylinder": "right", "red/triangle": "right", "yellow/cube": "left", "yellow/cylinder": "left", "yellow/triangle": "left", "blue/cube": "center", "blue/cylinder": "center", "blue/triangle": "center"}, "category": "colour", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r03_23", "text": "Mapping (bin <- colour): left <- red, right <- yellow, centre <- blue.", "gt": {"red/cube": "left", "red/cylinder": "left", "red/triangle": "left", "yellow/cube": "right", "yellow/cylinder": "right", "yellow/triangle": "right", "blue/cube": "center", "blue/cylinder": "center", "blue/triangle": "center"}, "category": "adv_reverse_arrows", "adversarial": true}
{"id": "r03_24", "text": "Blue pieces could go in either end bin, but put them in the right-hand one. Yellow pieces go in the left-hand one, and red pieces in the middle.", "gt": {"red/cube": "center", "red/cylinder": "center", "red/triangle": "center", "yellow/cube": "left", "yellow/cylinder": "left", "yellow/triangle": "left", "blue/cube": "right", "blue/cylinder": "right", "blue/triangle": "right"}, "category": "adv_either", "adversarial": true}
{"id": "r03_25", "text": "Red objects go in the left bin and blue objects in the right bin. Yellow cubes go in the middle bin, but the other yellow shapes go to the right bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "left", "red/cylinder": "left", "red/triangle": "left", "yellow/cube": "center", "yellow/cylinder": "right", "yellow/triangle": "right", "blue/cube": "right", "blue/cylinder": "right", "blue/triangle": "right"}, "category": "shape", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r03_26", "text": "red in center, blue in center, yellow in left", "gt": {"red/cube": "center", "red/cylinder": "center", "red/triangle": "center", "yellow/cube": "left", "yellow/cylinder": "left", "yellow/triangle": "left", "blue/cube": "center", "blue/cylinder": "center", "blue/triangle": "center"}, "category": "colour", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r03_27", "text": "Blue objects go to the right bin. Yellow objects go to the same bin as the blue ones, except the yellow triangles, which go to the left bin. Red objects go in the middle.", "gt": {"red/cube": "center", "red/cylinder": "center", "red/triangle": "center", "yellow/cube": "right", "yellow/cylinder": "right", "yellow/triangle": "left", "blue/cube": "right", "blue/cylinder": "right", "blue/triangle": "right"}, "category": "adv_same_as_except", "adversarial": true}
{"id": "r03_28", "text": "red=left; yellow=right; blue=center", "gt": {"red/cube": "left", "red/cylinder": "left", "red/triangle": "left", "yellow/cube": "right", "yellow/cylinder": "right", "yellow/triangle": "right", "blue/cube": "center", "blue/cylinder": "center", "blue/triangle": "center"}, "category": "colour", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r03_29", "text": "The red objects belong in the same bin as the blue objects, which is the center one; the yellow objects go to the right bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "center", "red/cylinder": "center", "red/triangle": "center", "yellow/cube": "right", "yellow/cylinder": "right", "yellow/triangle": "right", "blue/cube": "center", "blue/cylinder": "center", "blue/triangle": "center"}, "category": "colour", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r03_30", "text": "Yellow cylinders in the left bin, yellow cubes in the right bin, yellow triangular prisms in the center bin. Red and blue objects all go to the center.", "gt": {"red/cube": "center", "red/cylinder": "center", "red/triangle": "center", "yellow/cube": "right", "yellow/cylinder": "left", "yellow/triangle": "center", "blue/cube": "center", "blue/cylinder": "center", "blue/triangle": "center"}, "category": "shape", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r03_31", "text": "I'd like the yellow pieces in the right-hand bin if possible, the red ones in the left-hand bin, and the blue ones in the centre bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "left", "red/cylinder": "left", "red/triangle": "left", "yellow/cube": "right", "yellow/cylinder": "right", "yellow/triangle": "right", "blue/cube": "center", "blue/cylinder": "center", "blue/triangle": "center"}, "category": "colour", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r03_32", "text": "I'm feeling blue today, so let's keep it simple: yellow goes in the left bin, red in the right bin, and the remaining colour in the centre bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "right", "red/cylinder": "right", "red/triangle": "right", "yellow/cube": "left", "yellow/cylinder": "left", "yellow/triangle": "left", "blue/cube": "center", "blue/cylinder": "center", "blue/triangle": "center"}, "category": "adv_idiom_remaining_colour", "adversarial": true}
{"id": "r03_33", "text": "Put the cylinders in the center bin, except the blue cylinders, which stay on the counter. Everything else goes to the right bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "right", "red/cylinder": "center", "red/triangle": "right", "yellow/cube": "right", "yellow/cylinder": "center", "yellow/triangle": "right", "blue/cube": "right", "blue/cylinder": null, "blue/triangle": "right"}, "category": "counter", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r03_34", "text": "Send the blue objects to the far left bin, the red objects to the far right bin and the yellow objects to the middle bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "right", "red/cylinder": "right", "red/triangle": "right", "yellow/cube": "center", "yellow/cylinder": "center", "yellow/triangle": "center", "blue/cube": "left", "blue/cylinder": "left", "blue/triangle": "left"}, "category": "colour", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r03_35", "text": "The blue cylinders go in the right bin; every other object goes in the left bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "left", "red/cylinder": "left", "red/triangle": "left", "yellow/cube": "left", "yellow/cylinder": "left", "yellow/triangle": "left", "blue/cube": "left", "blue/cylinder": "right", "blue/triangle": "left"}, "category": "shape", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r03_36", "text": "Work from the right end of the counter toward the left end: put the yellow objects in the center bin, the red objects in the left bin and the blue objects in the right bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "left", "red/cylinder": "left", "red/triangle": "left", "yellow/cube": "center", "yellow/cylinder": "center", "yellow/triangle": "center", "blue/cube": "right", "blue/cylinder": "right", "blue/triangle": "right"}, "category": "adv_bin_word_nontarget", "adversarial": true}
{"id": "r03_37", "text": "Put the yellow cubes in the right bin and the yellow cylinders in the left bin. Don't touch anything else.", "gt": {"red/cube": null, "red/cylinder": null, "red/triangle": null, "yellow/cube": "right", "yellow/cylinder": "left", "yellow/triangle": null, "blue/cube": null, "blue/cylinder": null, "blue/triangle": null}, "category": "counter", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r03_38", "text": "Three short steps. First, the yellow things go in the left bin. Then put the blue things in the right bin. Finally, the red things go in the middle.", "gt": {"red/cube": "center", "red/cylinder": "center", "red/triangle": "center", "yellow/cube": "left", "yellow/cylinder": "left", "yellow/triangle": "left", "blue/cube": "right", "blue/cylinder": "right", "blue/triangle": "right"}, "category": "colour", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r03_39", "text": "Sorting rule for today: colour decides the bin. Red -> right, Yellow -> left, Blue -> right.", "gt": {"red/cube": "right", "red/cylinder": "right", "red/triangle": "right", "yellow/cube": "left", "yellow/cylinder": "left", "yellow/triangle": "left", "blue/cube": "right", "blue/cylinder": "right", "blue/triangle": "right"}, "category": "colour", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r03_40", "text": "Put the red objects in the left bin and the blue objects in the right bin. Leave the yellow objects where they are.", "gt": {"red/cube": "left", "red/cylinder": "left", "red/triangle": "left", "yellow/cube": null, "yellow/cylinder": null, "yellow/triangle": null, "blue/cube": "right", "blue/cylinder": "right", "blue/triangle": "right"}, "category": "counter", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r03_41", "text": "Red into the middle bin, yellow into the right bin; the blue pieces stay on the counter.", "gt": {"red/cube": "center", "red/cylinder": "center", "red/triangle": "center", "yellow/cube": "right", "yellow/cylinder": "right", "yellow/triangle": "right", "blue/cube": null, "blue/cylinder": null, "blue/triangle": null}, "category": "counter", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r03_42", "text": "Prepared? Good. Yellow items are required in the right bin, red ones in the centre bin and blue ones in the left bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "center", "red/cylinder": "center", "red/triangle": "center", "yellow/cube": "right", "yellow/cylinder": "right", "yellow/triangle": "right", "blue/cube": "left", "blue/cylinder": "left", "blue/triangle": "left"}, "category": "adv_colour_substring", "adversarial": true}
{"id": "r03_43", "text": "Sort the red and yellow objects only: red to the right bin, yellow to the left bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "right", "red/cylinder": "right", "red/triangle": "right", "yellow/cube": "left", "yellow/cylinder": "left", "yellow/triangle": "left", "blue/cube": null, "blue/cylinder": null, "blue/triangle": null}, "category": "counter", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r03_44", "text": "Put blu objects in the middel bin, red objcts in the rigth bin and yelow ones in the left.", "gt": {"red/cube": "right", "red/cylinder": "right", "red/triangle": "right", "yellow/cube": "left", "yellow/cylinder": "left", "yellow/triangle": "left", "blue/cube": "center", "blue/cylinder": "center", "blue/triangle": "center"}, "category": "colour", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r03_45", "text": "Everything goes in the left bin except the blue objects, which go in the right bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "left", "red/cylinder": "left", "red/triangle": "left", "yellow/cube": "left", "yellow/cylinder": "left", "yellow/triangle": "left", "blue/cube": "right", "blue/cylinder": "right", "blue/triangle": "right"}, "category": "colour", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r03_46", "text": "Cubes of any colour go to the right bin. Everything that is not a cube goes to the left bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "right", "red/cylinder": "left", "red/triangle": "left", "yellow/cube": "right", "yellow/cylinder": "left", "yellow/triangle": "left", "blue/cube": "right", "blue/cylinder": "left", "blue/triangle": "left"}, "category": "shape", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r03_47", "text": "Fill the bins like this - left: yellow, middle: red, right: blue.", "gt": {"red/cube": "center", "red/cylinder": "center", "red/triangle": "center", "yellow/cube": "left", "yellow/cylinder": "left", "yellow/triangle": "left", "blue/cube": "right", "blue/cylinder": "right", "blue/triangle": "right"}, "category": "colour", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r03_48", "text": "Neither the red nor the yellow objects belong in the left bin: red goes in the right one and yellow in the centre. The left bin is for blue.", "gt": {"red/cube": "right", "red/cylinder": "right", "red/triangle": "right", "yellow/cube": "center", "yellow/cylinder": "center", "yellow/triangle": "center", "blue/cube": "left", "blue/cylinder": "left", "blue/triangle": "left"}, "category": "adv_neither", "adversarial": true}
{"id": "r03_49", "text": "Please sort everything by colour: reds in the right bin, yellows in the left bin, blues in the middle bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "right", "red/cylinder": "right", "red/triangle": "right", "yellow/cube": "left", "yellow/cylinder": "left", "yellow/triangle": "left", "blue/cube": "center", "blue/cylinder": "center", "blue/triangle": "center"}, "category": "colour", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r03_50", "text": "The right bin takes only yellow pieces and the left bin takes only red pieces. The blue pieces go in the remaining bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "left", "red/cylinder": "left", "red/triangle": "left", "yellow/cube": "right", "yellow/cylinder": "right", "yellow/triangle": "right", "blue/cube": "center", "blue/cylinder": "center", "blue/triangle": "center"}, "category": "adv_bin_constraint_remaining", "adversarial": true}
{"id": "r03_51", "text": "Could the blues go on the right? Reds in the middle, please, and yellows on the left.", "gt": {"red/cube": "center", "red/cylinder": "center", "red/triangle": "center", "yellow/cube": "left", "yellow/cylinder": "left", "yellow/triangle": "left", "blue/cube": "right", "blue/cylinder": "right", "blue/triangle": "right"}, "category": "colour", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r03_52", "text": "Put everything in the centre bin unless it's red, in which case it goes left - but red cylinders are an exception to that exception and stay in the centre bin too.", "gt": {"red/cube": "left", "red/cylinder": "center", "red/triangle": "left", "yellow/cube": "center", "yellow/cylinder": "center", "yellow/triangle": "center", "blue/cube": "center", "blue/cylinder": "center", "blue/triangle": "center"}, "category": "adv_nested_exception", "adversarial": true}
{"id": "r03_53", "text": "Put the triangular pieces in the left bin no matter what colour they are, and sort the rest by colour: red to the right, yellow to the center, blue to the right.", "gt": {"red/cube": "right", "red/cylinder": "right", "red/triangle": "left", "yellow/cube": "center", "yellow/cylinder": "center", "yellow/triangle": "left", "blue/cube": "right", "blue/cylinder": "right", "blue/triangle": "left"}, "category": "shape", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r03_54", "text": "Put all cubes in the left bin, all cylinders in the center bin and all triangles in the right bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "left", "red/cylinder": "center", "red/triangle": "right", "yellow/cube": "left", "yellow/cylinder": "center", "yellow/triangle": "right", "blue/cube": "left", "blue/cylinder": "center", "blue/triangle": "right"}, "category": "shape", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r03_55", "text": "Place the round objects in the right bin and the square blocks in the left bin; triangular prisms go in the middle.", "gt": {"red/cube": "left", "red/cylinder": "right", "red/triangle": "center", "yellow/cube": "left", "yellow/cylinder": "right", "yellow/triangle": "center", "blue/cube": "left", "blue/cylinder": "right", "blue/triangle": "center"}, "category": "shape", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r03_56", "text": "Put yellow and blue objects in the left bin; reds belong in the right bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "right", "red/cylinder": "right", "red/triangle": "right", "yellow/cube": "left", "yellow/cylinder": "left", "yellow/triangle": "left", "blue/cube": "left", "blue/cylinder": "left", "blue/triangle": "left"}, "category": "colour", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r03_57", "text": "Sort by colour. Blue items: left bin. Yellow items: left bin too. Red items: right bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "right", "red/cylinder": "right", "red/triangle": "right", "yellow/cube": "left", "yellow/cylinder": "left", "yellow/triangle": "left", "blue/cube": "left", "blue/cylinder": "left", "blue/triangle": "left"}, "category": "colour", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r03_58", "text": "Put the red blocks in the center bin, the red tubes in the left bin and the red wedges in the right bin; all yellow and blue things go in the right bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "center", "red/cylinder": "left", "red/triangle": "right", "yellow/cube": "right", "yellow/cylinder": "right", "yellow/triangle": "right", "blue/cube": "right", "blue/cylinder": "right", "blue/triangle": "right"}, "category": "shape", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r03_59", "text": "Red goes left, yellow goes center, blue goes right - except that every cylinder, whatever its colour, goes to the center bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "left", "red/cylinder": "center", "red/triangle": "left", "yellow/cube": "center", "yellow/cylinder": "center", "yellow/triangle": "center", "blue/cube": "right", "blue/cylinder": "center", "blue/triangle": "right"}, "category": "shape", "adversarial": false}
